      "@type": "auto:Claim",
      "applicability": null,
      "assumptions": [],
      "canonicalJson": "{\"applicability\":null,\"conditions\":[\"冷态：油温室温或低于25℃\",\"热态：低速行驶5min以上、油温70～80℃\",\"适用对象: 通用（书未限定具体车型或变速器型号）\"],\"counterexamples\":[],\"evidence_ids\":[\"book:1jDTXgUQ5NSX-YyBkMFuKnrwmhec4F84E:ev:p10:e5\"],\"id\":\"claim:1jDTXgUQ5NSX-YyBkMFuKnrwmhec4F84E:c01q0105:0051\",\"predicate\":\"interpretation\",\"qualification_status\":\"EXTRACTED_UNCHECKED\",\"source_kind\":\"BOOK_BODY_DIRECT\",\"statement\":\"油面合格区间随油温不同：冷态看下限、热态看上限。\",\"subject_id\":\"book:1jDTXgUQ5NSX-YyBkMFuKnrwmhec4F84E:ent:k16\",\"unknowns\":[],\"value\":\"冷态（冷车刚刚启动、油温为室温或低于 25℃）时油面高度应在油尺刻线下限附近；热态（低速行驶 5min 以上、油温已达 70～80℃）时应在油尺刻线上限附近。\"}",
