      "canonicalJson": "{\"applicability\":null,\"conditions\":[\"蓄电池电压正常\",\"适用对象: 通用（书未限定具体车型或变速器型号）\"],\"counterexamples\":[],\"evidence_ids\":[\"book:1jDTXgUQ5NSX-YyBkMFuKnrwmhec4F84E:ev:p11:e5\"],\"id\":\"claim:1jDTXgUQ5NSX-YyBkMFuKnrwmhec4F84E:c01q0105:0069\",\"predicate\":\"requires_precondition\",\"qualification_status\":\"EXTRACTED_UNCHECKED\",\"source_kind\":\"BOOK_BODY_DIRECT\",\"statement\":\"O/D 检验的前提是蓄电池电压正常，否则自诊断系统会误诊断。\",\"subject_id\":\"book:1jDTXgUQ5NSX-YyBkMFuKnrwmhec4F84E:ent:k21\",\"unknowns\":[],\"value\":\"自动变速器的电子控制系统具有故障自诊断功能，可以通过超速挡指示灯『O/D OFF』予以警告；此项检验必须在蓄电池电压正常时方可进行，否则将会引起故障自诊断系统误诊断。\"}",
